 ('Reading · A professional e-mail',mail('ana@firm.com','leo@firm.com','Catching up on the proposal',['Hi Leo,','Sorry for the delay: I have not **got round to** the budget yet. I am trying to **get across** our main point, and I am slowly **getting the hang of** the new software. We cannot **get away with** vague figures, but we can **get by** with the current team.','Could you **get back to** me by Friday? I would **get ahead of** the schedule if I had your numbers.','Best, Ana'],gloss=[('budget','orçamento'),('delay','atraso'),('figures','números'),('vague','vago')])),
 [('Ana has finished the budget.','F','not got round to.'),('The team can get by with current staff.','T','get by.'),('Ana wants an answer by Friday.','T','by Friday.')],
 [('“get the hang of” = ?',['pegar o jeito','pegar o cabide','ficar pendurado'],0,'getting the hang of.'),('“vague” = ?',['vago, impreciso','vazio','vale'],0,'vague figures.')],
 G('Verbo-chave: get',['Expressão','Significado','Exemplo'],[['get across','fazer entender','**I want to get our point across.**'],['get by','virar-se','**We can get by with less.**'],['get round to','arranjar tempo para','**I haven’t got round to it.**'],['get the hang of','pegar o jeito','**She got the hang of it.**'],['get away with','escapar impune','**You can’t get away with that.**'],['get back to','retornar o contato','**I’ll get back to you.**']],'**get** tem dezenas de sentidos: receber, tornar-se, chegar, entender. No C1 domine as **combinações fixas**.'),
 [('I haven’t got ___ to the budget. (round)','round','get round to.',None),('Please get ___ to me by Friday. (back)','back','retornar.',None),('We can’t get ___ with vague figures. (away)','away','impune.',None),('She is getting the ___ of the software. (hang)','hang','pegar o jeito.',None)],
 V('proposal draft=rascunho de proposta|budget line=linha orçamentária|vague figure=número impreciso|follow-up reminder=lembrete de acompanhamento|schedule slip=atraso no cronograma|new software=software novo|key message=mensagem principal|cost estimate=estimativa de custos|reply deadline=prazo de resposta|working draft=rascunho de trabalho|cover note=nota de apresentação|attachment size=tamanho do anexo|read receipt=confirmação de leitura|inbox backlog=acúmulo na caixa de entrada|delayed reply=resposta atrasada|polite nudge=lembrete educado|business e-mail=e-mail profissional|subject line=linha de assunto|sign-off=encerramento|formal greeting=saudação formal|stakeholder update=atualização para partes interessadas|approval chain=cadeia de aprovação|fiscal quarter=trimestre fiscal|cost cutting=corte de custos|team capacity=capacidade da equipe|staffing level=nível de pessoal|action item=item de ação|decision memo=memorando de decisão'),
