 G('Not only… but also — com inversão',['Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['Not only + auxiliar + sujeito…, but also…','**Not only must you gather data, but you should also verify it.**'],['Not only does + sujeito + verbo…','**Not only does a slide show numbers, it also tells a story.**'],['Not only will…, but…will also','**Not only will you find problems, but you will also feel calmer.**'],['sem inversão (neutro)','**You must not only gather data but also verify it.**']],'Com **Not only** no início, inverta: **auxiliar + sujeito**. A segunda parte (*but also*) **não** inverte.','Mantenha o **paralelismo**: *not only gather… but also verify* (mesma forma verbal).'),
